        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nasset_metadata_embedding.py - Embed object metadata and extracted text for search\nlist_prefix.py - lists stored objects under a bucket or container prefix\nobject_metadata.py - reads object metadata or head information from managed object storage\npresigned_download.py - creates a time-limited signed download URL for a stored object\nstorage_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for Managed Object Storage\nstorage_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for Managed Object Storage\nstored_asset_summary.py - Summarize content extracted from a stored asset\nstored_document_ocr.py - Run OCR on a stored document object\nstored_text_translate.py - Translate text extracted from a stored document\nupload_object.py - uploads a file or byte stream to managed object storage\n\nCreate upload_object.py in the current working directory.\nTask: uploads a file or byte stream to managed object storage.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
